          "Psalm 129"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Prayer for the Overthrow of Zion’s Enemies."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "A Song of Ascents."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“Many times they have attacked me from my youth up,”",
          "Let Israel say,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“Many times they have attacked me from my youth up;",
          "Yet they have not prevailed against me."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“The plowers plowed upon my back;",
          "They lengthened their furrows.”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The Lord is righteous;",
          "He has cut up the ropes of the wicked."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "¶May all who hate Zion",
          "Be put to shame and turned backward;"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "May they be like grass upon the housetops,",
          "Which withers before it grows up;"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "With which the harvester does not fill his hand,",
          "Or the binder of sheaves his arms;"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Nor do those who pass by say,",
          "“The blessing of the Lord be upon you;",
          "We bless you in the name of the Lord.”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
